1
00:00:06,697 --> 00:00:08,737
I got tired of waiting.

2
00:00:09,737 --> 00:00:12,157
Waiting for this time and place.

3
00:00:20,297 --> 00:00:21,507
Who are you?

4
00:00:21,917 --> 00:00:23,337
I told you, didn't I?

5
00:00:23,967 --> 00:00:28,507
I said you were me, and I was you.

6
00:00:36,517 --> 00:00:38,307
I welcome you.

7
00:00:38,307 --> 00:00:40,857
The one who clung to the mercy of his loved one,

8
00:00:40,857 --> 00:00:43,897
erased his own memories, and ran away has returned.

9
00:00:43,897 --> 00:00:45,067
Stop it.

10
00:00:45,697 --> 00:00:47,367
What do you mean?

11
00:00:47,367 --> 00:00:48,737
Re-l Mayer,

12
00:00:49,327 --> 00:00:52,117
your role ends here.

13
00:00:52,117 --> 00:00:55,667
The rest of the show is for him and me.

14
00:01:03,207 --> 00:01:05,717
Foolish defect...

15
00:01:09,097 --> 00:01:10,177
Daedalus!

16
00:01:10,177 --> 00:01:11,637
What is he doing?

17
00:01:11,637 --> 00:01:17,517
I whispered the prepared scenario for when
 the time came for the dome's destruction to him.

18
00:01:18,057 --> 00:01:21,767
It seems his destructive impulses have also been awakened...

19
00:01:22,277 --> 00:01:24,027
just as ours had.

20
00:01:26,607 --> 00:01:28,277
It's futile!

21
00:01:30,867 --> 00:01:32,827
Accede to fate.

22
00:01:32,827 --> 00:01:36,787
Even if you people survive, you can't be the winners.

23
00:01:36,787 --> 00:01:41,627
Even so, I will not run away from the
 reality of what is happening right now.

24
00:01:43,707 --> 00:01:48,297
Even if an even harsher reality awaits...

25
00:01:50,257 --> 00:01:53,967
I will do what I must. I will come back, no matter what.

26
00:01:53,967 --> 00:01:56,557
That's a promise, Vincent.

27
00:01:57,187 --> 00:01:58,347
Re-l...

28
00:02:03,777 --> 00:02:04,937
Re-l...

