Now, take a good look.

2141
00:04:11,567 --> 00:04:13,947
That's what you look like.

2142
00:04:14,777 --> 00:04:19,447
That mask you wear is the shape of
 the soul of one who has escaped fate.

2143
00:04:19,737 --> 00:04:22,247
Let's confirm this again:

2144
00:04:22,247 --> 00:04:24,707
Have you really erased your memories?

2145
00:04:24,707 --> 00:04:29,047
Did you even have those memories in the first place?

2146
00:04:29,587 --> 00:04:34,927
Perhaps you are merely a fool entrapped with
 the notion that his memories have been erased.

2147
00:04:35,507 --> 00:04:38,757
In the end, you know nothing...

2148
00:04:38,757 --> 00:04:39,927
Am I wrong?

2149
00:04:39,927 --> 00:04:40,967
You're wrong!

2150
00:04:41,307 --> 00:04:45,097
The journey... That in itself was necessary.

2151
00:04:45,597 --> 00:04:50,017
I perceived the steady recovery of nature from destruction

2152
00:04:50,017 --> 00:04:55,907
with all of my senses, and felt it with my heart.

2153
00:04:56,697 --> 00:05:01,327
If I had not done that, I wouldn't have wanted to return here.

2154
00:05:01,327 --> 00:05:06,997
It is indeed true that, while it nurtures,
 neither the cradle nor the ark educates.

2155
00:05:07,497 --> 00:05:14,467
And the experience of facing the world by
 oneself would drastically change one's views.

2156
00:05:16,547 --> 00:05:21,637
It seems you did receive my message, then.

2157
00:05:22,007 --> 00:05:23,057
Answer me!

2158
00:05:23,057 --> 00:05:24,677
What are we...

2159
00:05:24,677 --> 00:05:26,637
What are PROXIES?

2160
00:05:27,227 --> 00:05:31,017
PROXIES - just interpret the name literally.

2161
00:05:31,017 --> 00:05:34,857
We are the Creator's proxies.

2162
00:05:35,187 --> 00:05:37,067
The Creator...

2163
00:05:42,907 --> 00:05:46,867
meditation  proxy

2164
00:05:42,907 --> 00:05:46,867
meditation  proxy

2165
00:05:42,907 --> 00:05:46,867
meditation  proxy

2166
00:05:50,537 --> 00:05:52,037
Vincent...

2167
00:06:13,937 --> 00:06:17,947
And then... I understood all of it.

2168
00:06:17,947 --> 00:06:19,407
Where are you?

2169
00:06:22,947 --> 00:06:26,907
I understood all of the malice the Creator wrought.

2170
00:06:27,197 --> 00:06:32,497
After prolonged suffering, I finally fulfilled my duty as a proxy.

2171
00:06:32,497 --> 00:06:37,717
The moment I succeeded in reviving
 humanity, the changes in my body began.

2172
00:06:37,717 --> 00:06:40,217
That was the heartbeat of beginning...

2173
00:06:40,587 --> 00:06:43,467
the commencement of the PROXY destruction program.

2174
00:06:43,467 --> 00:06:46,427
Then... you took humanity and...

2175
00:06:46,427 --> 00:06:50,937
However, we cannot fight the program.

2176
00:06:51,687 --> 00:06:54,477
An extremely reasonable system...

2177
00:06:54,477 --> 00:06:56,227
How ironic.

2178
00:06:56,647 --> 00:07:01,107
Even though PROXIES are messengers
 of God, once they fulfill their mission,

2179
00:07:01,107 --> 00:07:05,577
they are unnecessary elements that are left
 behind after humanity is led to the Promised Land.

2180
00:07:05,577 --> 00:07:09,657
Worse, they are merely monsters... demons.

2181
00:07:09,657 --> 00:07:15,917
But even the ark, which according to
 that plan was to have been abandoned,

2182
00:07:15,917 --> 00:07:18,087
had developed a soul...

2183
00:07:18,087 --> 00:07:19,297
Why...

2184
00:07:19,297 --> 00:07:22,387
Why did the Creator give us souls?

2185
00:07:22,757 --> 00:07:25,757
If we did not have souls, we wouldn't suffer...

2186
00:07:25,757 --> 00:07:27,637
You must know why.

2187
00:07:28,717 --> 00:07:29,927
Yes...

2188
00:07:29,927 --> 00:07:32,017
I have no need for an answer.

2189
00:07:32,307 --> 00:07:38,987
We came to understand through our own efforts.

2190
00:07:38,987 --> 00:07:45,527
We were worshipped, betrayed, and brought to despair

2191
00:07:45,527 --> 00:07:48,077
by the defective humans we created.

2192
00:07:48,367 --> 00:07:51,537
And yet we still love them.

2193
00:07:51,537 --> 00:07:54,577
The Creator must have wanted to be loved as well,

2194
00:07:55,247 --> 00:07:59,797
just as we savored their love in our solitude.

2195
00:08:00,377 --> 00:08:05,337
And that is why we must punish them.

2196
00:08:05,337 --> 00:08:07,597
What can we possibly do now?

2197
00:08:07,597 --> 00:08:12,177
If you've rebuilt humanity as they've desired...

2198
00:08:13,437 --> 00:08:17,687
Did you come to a realization, Vincent
 Law, you who have forgotten everything?

2199
00:08:17,687 --> 00:08:22,947
That is proof that you are an entrapped shadow.

2200
00:08:23,397 --> 00:08:25,067
I manipulated you,

2201
00:08:25,067 --> 00:08:27,577
caused emotions to take root in the defects,

2202
00:08:27,577 --> 00:08:30,617
and re-annihilated the newly resurrected humanity...

2203
00:08:32,787 --> 00:08:35,207
Then, humanity has been...

2204
00:08:35,957 --> 00:08:37,037
The shadow will know

2205
00:08:37,497 --> 00:08:42,877
the fate of those who were punished
 for desiring God in a godless world.

2206
00:08:43,417 --> 00:08:45,837
Humanity was meant to perish,

2207
00:08:45,837 --> 00:08:49,507
for they led the world to destruction and then fled,

2208
00:08:50,717 --> 00:08:57,647
just as you fled Romdeau, the world that you created.

2209
00:08:57,647 --> 00:09:03,277
Vincent Law is the afterimage of
 PROXY One who was taken by despair.

2210
00:09:03,277 --> 00:09:09,447
No. He is merely the doppelgÃ¤nger left behind by Ergo PROXY, a fake.

2211
00:09:10,027 --> 00:09:11,237
A fake...

2212
00:09:11,237 --> 00:09:14,407
However, a well-made fake.

2213
00:09:15,327 --> 00:09:16,997
Think about it.

2214
00:09:16,997 --> 00:09:20,417
You also despaired and left this place.

2215
00:09:20,417 --> 00:09:23,007
You fled from everything.

2216
00:09:23,417 --> 00:09:26,467
You and I... we are the same.

2217
00:09:26,467 --> 00:09:27,797
Shut up!

2218
00:09:27,797 --> 00:09:29,547
Then fight!

2219
00:09:39,937 --> 00:09:43,277
Number five and number eight have been silenced.

2220
00:09:43,277 --> 00:09:45,897
All of the dome's backup power sources have been killed.

2221
00:09:46,357 --> 00:09:48,407
The destruction cannot be stopped.

2222
00:09:55,577 --> 00:09:56,827
Daedalus.

2223
00:10:01,037 --> 00:10:02,287
That's right!

2224
00:10:02,287 --> 00:10:04,457
Obey your instincts!

2225
00:10:04,457 --> 00:10:06,967
Liberate yourself!

2226
00:10:11,717 --> 00:10:13,177
I can understand!

2227
00:10:13,887 --> 00:10:17,387
Understand the sadness of having
 your insignificant existence rejected.

2228
00:10:25,067 --> 00:10:28,817
I don't care who I was before I became who I am.

2229
00:10:28,817 --> 00:10:31,567
But I am just myself.

2230
00:10:31,567 --> 00:10:34,367
That is the only truth!

2231
00:10:35,997 --> 00:10:38,457
Indeed, there is only one truth.

2232
00:10:38,907 --> 00:10:44,337
We tear apart the message entrusted by a
 selfish race who destroyed themselves, then run away.

2233
00:10:44,627 --> 00:10:47,207
Isn't that who we are?

2234
00:10:47,507 --> 00:10:49,377
You are right.

2235
00:10:51,257 --> 00:10:55,637
You and I are Ergo PROXY,

2236
00:10:57,267 --> 00:10:58,767
PROXY One.

2237
00:11:18,787 --> 00:11:20,577
We have been abandoned.

2238
00:11:21,497 --> 00:11:23,327
It is meaningless.

2239
00:11:23,957 --> 00:11:25,457
You haven't changed at all.

2240
00:11:25,957 --> 00:11:27,417
You make me sick.

2241
00:11:28,877 --> 00:11:29,967
Don't you get it?

2242
00:11:30,547 --> 00:11:33,547
Both this play and our roles in it have ended.

2243
00:11:34,007 --> 00:11:36,007
Romdeau is finished.

2244
00:11:37,097 --> 00:11:40,267
And defective citizens can only disappear.

2245
00:11:40,267 --> 00:11:41,807
That's not true.

2246
00:11:42,347 --> 00:11:44,807
There must be something we can still do!

2247
00:11:44,807 --> 00:11:47,777
No, this is the end.

2248
00:11:47,777 --> 00:11:52,907
Besides, what difference can we,
 pseudo-humans, make in the battle between gods?

2249
00:11:53,527 --> 00:11:56,867
As mere cogs in the wheel, we can be silent.

2250
00:11:57,157 --> 00:11:59,617
Yes, like Donov.

2251
00:12:00,957 --> 00:12:03,957
What Grandfather desired... A meeting with the Creator...

2252
00:12:04,457 --> 00:12:09,257
Even if that was the reason why I was born, I didn't care.

2253
00:12:09,257 --> 00:12:14,047
I have always wanted to love
 Grandfather from the bottom of my heart.

2254
00:12:14,927 --> 00:12:17,347
I wanted to feel that I was loved.

2255
00:12:18,307 --> 00:12:20,517
I just wanted to be loved.

2256
00:12:21,227 --> 00:12:23,517
But the Administrator rejected even that.

2257
00:12:24,477 --> 00:12:25,767
He's the same.

2258
00:12:25,767 --> 00:12:32,697
He only opened his heart to Vincent Law... no, to Ergo PROXY.

2259
00:12:33,817 --> 00:12:35,357
You're the same too.

2260
00:12:35,357 --> 00:12:36,527
I...

2261
00:12:37,317 --> 00:12:38,657
Daedalus.

2262
00:12:40,827 --> 00:12:42,707
Too bad.

2263
00:12:42,707 --> 00:12:45,957
PROXIES can't live under a blue sky.

2264
00:12:46,417 --> 00:12:48,837
Their amrita cells do not permit that.

2265
00:12:49,127 --> 00:12:50,337
What do you mean?

2266
00:12:50,337 --> 00:12:54,927
They, too, are beings meant to be eradicated from this world.

2267
00:12:59,347 --> 00:13:02,727
So that's where you were, my beloved!

2268
00:13:03,177 --> 00:13:04,977
Re-l-2, Real!

2269
00:13:06,727 --> 00:13:08,267
Wonderful...

2270
00:13:08,727 --> 00:13:10,267
She is complete!

2271
00:13:10,267 --> 00:13:12,737
I created a god!

2272
00:13:12,737 --> 00:13:14,237
Come, Re-l...

2273
00:13:14,777 --> 00:13:16,357
Come for me.

2274
00:13:16,857 --> 00:13:18,407
Not that way.

2275
00:13:18,407 --> 00:13:19,737
Don't go!

2276
00:13:22,197 --> 00:13:26,997
Why does Re-l always leave me behind?

2277
00:13:26,997 --> 00:13:27,957
Please don't go.

2278
00:13:28,497 --> 00:13:29,747
Daedalus!

2279
00:13:42,057 --> 00:13:45,057
But you are not Vincent Law!

2280
00:13:45,057 --> 00:13:48,767
Why hesitate over a fake created by defects?

2281
00:13:49,057 --> 00:13:50,767
And what can you possibly know?

2282
00:13:50,767 --> 00:13:52,357
I know.

2283
00:13:52,357 --> 00:13:53,687
I already told you...

2284
00:13:53,687 --> 00:13:54,277
I am...

2285
00:13:54,277 --> 00:13:55,647
You, right?

2286
00:13:56,147 --> 00:13:57,527
That's why I came back...

2287
00:13:57,817 --> 00:13:59,817
to kill me!

2288
00:14:03,537 --> 00:14:06,287
What must be saved isn't the world!

2289
00:14:04,997 --> 00:14:05,997
Over there!

2290
00:14:06,747 --> 00:14:08,707
But what would that change?

2291
00:14:09,207 --> 00:14:11,377
Continuing to kill wouldn't-

2292
00:14:10,667 --> 00:14:11,707
Please stop!

2293
00:14:12,497 --> 00:14:15,207
The PROXIES' role is finished!

2294
00:14:20,427 --> 00:14:22,717
You again...

2295
00:14:22,717 --> 00:14:24,097
Monad.

2296
00:14:25,597 --> 00:14:26,927
Monad...

2297
00:14:27,557 --> 00:14:29,057
I've finally found you.

2298
00:14:29,477 --> 00:14:33,067
I've been looking... for you.

2299
00:14:33,067 --> 00:14:35,357
Don't interfere, Monad.

2300
00:14:35,357 --> 00:14:39,447
It is true that the proxies' role is finished.

2301
00:14:39,447 --> 00:14:44,487
And... the humanity I resurrected has been destroyed.

2302
00:14:44,487 --> 00:14:46,947
The immortal "winner" will also be destroyed.

2303
00:14:48,207 --> 00:14:49,997
This was also part of your plan?

2304
00:14:49,997 --> 00:14:52,417
This is my revenge.

2305
00:14:52,417 --> 00:14:54,457
The rest is up to you.

2306
00:14:54,457 --> 00:14:57,877
That will be... your world.

2307
00:14:57,877 --> 00:14:58,967
You...

2308
00:14:58,967 --> 00:15:03,257
You're going to burden me with everything again?

2309
00:15:03,887 --> 00:15:06,177
You don't have to save a world like this!

2310
00:15:07,387 --> 00:15:09,057
I know.

2311
00:15:09,057 --> 00:15:11,307
I know you can't do that.

2312
00:15:11,307 --> 00:15:13,727
So it's all right now.

2313
00:15:13,727 --> 00:15:16,727
Stop, Monad.

2314
00:15:17,027 --> 00:15:18,987
It's over for everyone!

2315
00:15:18,987 --> 00:15:21,157
I don't want to see anyone grieve anymore.

2316
00:15:21,987 --> 00:15:23,487
Monad...

2317
00:15:23,487 --> 00:15:25,617
Are you going to run away again?

2318
00:15:27,577 --> 00:15:30,157
Don't listen to anyone.

2319
00:15:30,827 --> 00:15:33,167
Close your sacred eyes.

2320
00:15:33,667 --> 00:15:35,997
Please stop, Monad.

2321
00:16:36,687 --> 00:16:38,187
That's right.

2322
00:16:38,187 --> 00:16:41,147
They were all told not to listen to the PROXY.

2323
00:16:43,647 --> 00:16:46,777
But I want to help Vince.

2324
00:16:49,327 --> 00:16:52,447
I wonder why I'm different from everybody.

2325
00:16:52,447 --> 00:16:54,407
There's nothing different about you.

2326
00:16:57,827 --> 00:16:58,957
Kristeva.

2327
00:16:59,417 --> 00:17:01,707
When they say cogito has created a fledgling self...

2328
00:17:01,707 --> 00:17:04,217
it means someone is following their own will.

2329
00:17:04,217 --> 00:17:07,137
It doesn't mean you have to ignore PROXIES.

2330
00:17:07,677 --> 00:17:09,757
You hear it too?

2331
00:17:10,967 --> 00:17:13,727
You just need to do what your heart tells you.

2332
00:17:25,777 --> 00:17:27,157
Where's my Papa?

2333
00:17:29,777 --> 00:17:31,867
He told me to give this to you.

2334
00:17:39,837 --> 00:17:41,127
Let's hurry, Pino.

2335
00:17:41,417 --> 00:17:42,247
Yep!

2336
00:17:53,637 --> 00:17:56,977
Cogito was built into the PROXY Plan.

2337
00:17:56,977 --> 00:17:59,227
It was mankind's safety valve.

2338
00:18:01,017 --> 00:18:05,487
Autoreivs were just part of the PROXY Plan.

2339
00:18:06,237 --> 00:18:09,447
Their revolt helped bring about the plan's ruin.

2340
00:18:11,067 --> 00:18:12,777
That's enough, Daedalus.

2341
00:18:13,237 --> 00:18:14,787
In other words...

2342
00:18:14,787 --> 00:18:20,327
bringing back the human race through
 the PROXY project wasn't the first option.

2343
00:18:21,457 --> 00:18:26,547
Everything here right now is an obstacle to the first option.

2344
00:18:27,007 --> 00:18:29,257
That includes you and me.

2345
00:18:30,007 --> 00:18:31,967
Despite all our pain...

2346
00:18:32,467 --> 00:18:34,057
and love...

2347
00:18:34,507 --> 00:18:35,717
even our souls are...

2348
00:18:36,017 --> 00:18:37,177
Daedalus...

2349
00:18:37,177 --> 00:18:38,557
Go, Re-l.

2350
00:18:39,847 --> 00:18:45,727
There's still a truth you have to face, isn't there?

2351
00:18:46,487 --> 00:18:48,487
That gave me trouble...

2352
00:18:49,397 --> 00:18:53,487
but you're my favorite, Re-l.

2353
00:18:53,487 --> 00:18:54,487
Daedalus.

2354
00:18:56,747 --> 00:18:58,327
You don't have much time.

2355
00:18:59,407 --> 00:19:01,377
Go straight through here...

2356
00:19:01,377 --> 00:19:05,247
follow the maintenance rail and you'll come to the plug vent.

2357
00:19:05,547 --> 00:19:06,457
Hurry.

2358
00:19:08,297 --> 00:19:10,507
I'm sorry, Daedalus.

2359
00:19:11,087 --> 00:19:13,097
I'm sick and tired of hearing you say that, Re-l.

2360
00:19:16,887 --> 00:19:19,097
I'd better go, Daedalus.

2361
00:19:20,637 --> 00:19:21,687
Yes.

2362
00:19:28,897 --> 00:19:30,647
Run, Re-l!

2363
00:19:33,657 --> 00:19:34,947
That's it.

2364
00:19:52,177 --> 00:19:53,967
What is this light?

2365
00:19:54,587 --> 00:19:56,427
It is holy.

2366
00:19:57,887 --> 00:19:59,467
A portent of rebirth.

2367
00:20:02,267 --> 00:20:03,767
The sun...

2368
00:20:04,307 --> 00:20:05,267
I'm sure.

2369
00:20:05,267 --> 00:20:06,267
Yes,

2370
00:20:07,357 --> 00:20:11,737
a true blue sky will spread as far as the eye can see...

2371
00:20:11,737 --> 00:20:13,657
shining and beautiful forever.

2372
00:20:16,367 --> 00:20:20,287
So you don't have to worry about anything anymore.

2373
00:20:21,617 --> 00:20:22,787
Yes...

2374
00:20:47,267 --> 00:20:48,517
Wait.

2375
00:20:48,857 --> 00:20:50,357
What's wrong?

2376
00:20:50,357 --> 00:20:52,777
Why do you look sad?

2377
00:20:54,777 --> 00:20:56,907
Forget everything.

2378
00:20:56,907 --> 00:20:58,067
I'm sorry.

2379
00:21:00,077 --> 00:21:01,237
Why?

2380
00:21:02,287 --> 00:21:05,577
I must no longer forget.

2381
00:21:11,957 --> 00:21:16,507
It's not about duties or fate.

2382
00:21:16,507 --> 00:21:19,427
Facing each other. Fighting each other.

2383
00:21:19,427 --> 00:21:22,517
Supporting each other. Holding each other.

2384
00:21:22,517 --> 00:21:23,807
We live on.

2385
00:21:28,437 --> 00:21:31,317
What is good about that reality?

2386
00:21:32,357 --> 00:21:37,817
A reality so dark... cold... and with such an uncertain future.

2387
00:21:43,617 --> 00:21:45,157
But that...

2388
00:21:46,117 --> 00:21:47,827
is our reality.

2389
00:21:49,747 --> 00:21:53,207
Even in a world like that, someone is waiting for me.

2390
00:21:53,507 --> 00:21:54,797
It's her, isn't it.

2391
00:21:58,297 --> 00:22:01,297
I'll return this to you, Monad.

2392
00:22:07,387 --> 00:22:08,767
Vincent...

2393
00:22:11,607 --> 00:22:14,567
Goodbye, Real.

2394
00:22:24,697 --> 00:22:27,617
Goodbye, my beloved.

2395
00:22:29,827 --> 00:22:33,127
No, don't fly so high.

2396
00:22:37,417 --> 00:22:40,837
Ah, the world is so beautiful.

2397
00:22:41,387 --> 00:22:42,677
And yet...

2398
00:22:44,257 --> 00:22:46,597
which sky should I seek?

2399
00:22:49,637 --> 00:22:50,847
I can hear it.

2400
00:22:53,937 --> 00:22:55,147
"The plan"...

2401
00:22:56,187 --> 00:22:57,607
"Transition."

2402
00:23:00,527 --> 00:23:02,117
So it was you...

2403
00:23:03,067 --> 00:23:04,827
who was calling.

2404
00:23:06,947 --> 00:23:08,287
Vincent...

2405
00:23:09,407 --> 00:23:12,287
In the end, the future you chose is...

2406
00:23:15,087 --> 00:23:18,257
Let us welcome the Creator.

2407
00:23:18,257 --> 00:23:20,297
D-Don't...

2408
00:23:21,007 --> 00:23:24,597
But in that sky... you'll...

2409
00:23:47,197 --> 00:23:49,037
So you returned.

2410
00:23:49,037 --> 00:23:49,827
Yes.

2411
00:23:50,287 --> 00:23:52,287
Vincent Law,

2412
00:23:52,827 --> 00:23:55,087
you are truly a shadow.

2413
00:23:56,087 --> 00:23:58,877
The shadow has defeated me, an immortal,

2414
00:23:59,417 --> 00:24:02,587
and broken the shackles of the heartbeat.

2415
00:24:02,587 --> 00:24:10,097
And that was also the liberation of the imperfect ones you loved.

2416
00:24:10,597 --> 00:24:12,557
That's right.

2417
00:24:13,597 --> 00:24:17,107
A woman who can see into the future...

2418
00:24:17,397 --> 00:24:23,147
She is indeed your - Vincent Law's - reality.

2419
00:24:28,907 --> 00:24:30,787
The sun will return.

2420
00:24:31,247 --> 00:24:33,537
Our world will end.

2421
00:24:33,997 --> 00:24:35,327
However...

2422
00:24:38,667 --> 00:24:41,667
Live, Vincent.

2423
00:24:41,667 --> 00:24:45,887
Your survival will be the Creator's punishment.

2424
00:25:04,487 --> 00:25:05,697
Dammit.

2425
00:25:05,697 --> 00:25:07,117
After coming this far...

2426
00:25:25,177 --> 00:25:26,377
Dammit...

2427
00:25:26,377 --> 00:25:27,587
Is this it?

2428
00:25:28,927 --> 00:25:31,057
Re-l-Re-l!

2429
00:25:32,807 --> 00:25:35,187
Re-l-Re-l!

2430
00:25:36,477 --> 00:25:39,307
Re-l-Re-l!

2431
00:25:39,307 --> 00:25:40,477
Pino!

2432
00:25:42,477 --> 00:25:43,777
I have faith.

2433
00:26:09,547 --> 00:26:11,097
You're Raul's...

2434
00:26:11,467 --> 00:26:13,677
Protecting Pino...

2435
00:26:13,677 --> 00:26:18,977
It was the last duty as an Entourage that he charged me with.

2436
00:26:19,397 --> 00:26:21,897
She found this for me too.

2437
00:26:28,277 --> 00:26:29,987
Is Vincent...

2438
00:26:29,987 --> 00:26:31,487
Don't worry.

2439
00:26:31,487 --> 00:26:34,157
I can hear his voice.

2440
00:26:36,787 --> 00:26:38,957
I can see Vince.

2441
00:26:39,457 --> 00:26:42,037
Distance: 1107 units!

2442
00:26:46,457 --> 00:26:48,217
What a troublemaker.

2443
00:26:50,587 --> 00:26:53,677
I guess we'll have to go get him.

2444
00:26:54,007 --> 00:26:54,887
Yeah!

2445
00:27:17,947 --> 00:27:23,667
<i>This world is the reality we face.</i>

2446
00:27:23,667 --> 00:27:25,247
<i>But I...</i>

2447
00:27:25,707 --> 00:27:30,427
<i>will face this world with Re-l and the others who have survived.</i>

2448
00:27:36,677 --> 00:27:40,267
<i>Now that man has returned for the
 first time in several thousand years</i>

2449
00:27:40,267 --> 00:27:43,647
<i>to a land that nears complete revival,</i>

2450
00:27:44,517 --> 00:27:47,027
<i>the true battle will begin.</i>

2451
00:27:48,477 --> 00:27:51,147
<i>I am Ergo PROXY...</i>

2452
00:27:53,697 --> 00:27:56,027
<i>the proxy of death.</i>

